Package: dde-pdf-printer
Version: 0.8.7
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: DDE PDF Printer Developers <dev@example.com>
Depends: cups, cups-filters, ghostscript, dde-control-center
Recommends: dde-api
Description: DDE virtual PDF printer (CUPS backend + control center plugin)
 Provides a virtual PDF printer for DDE desktop, similar to
 "Microsoft Print to PDF" on Windows. Includes a CUPS backend
 and a DDE control center plugin for management. After
 installation, a "DDE-PDF" printer is available in any
 application's print dialog, and generated PDF files are saved
 to the user's ~/PDF directory.
